  "description": "Critical skills coverage: a row per skill, thinnest first, and a cell per lab plus the estate total holding the count of people with the skill. Cells are muted at 0, amber with the word thin at 1 or 2, sage at 3 and above; a Depth pill names the estate-wide flag in words.",
  "data": {
    "name": "dataset"
  },
  "width": "container",
  "height": "container",
  "background": "transparent",
  "params": [
    {
